      "id": "demonstratifs-localiser",
      "title": "Ce, cet, cette, ces et la localisation",
      "minutes": 9,
      "lede": "To point at an object (this/that), French uses the demonstrative adjectives. To say where it is, you use five little prepositions.",
      "blocks": [
